  "description": "Bring home the groceries, take your kids to school, or plan a weekend adventure carrying all the gear you need. PakYak E+ is the best electric cargo bike for family, kids, and the things you love! The PakYak E+ electric cargo bike combines powerful pedaling support with thoughtful functionality that makes it fun to simplify your life and ride instead of drive. The SyncDrive Pro mid-drive motor delivers seamless pedaling assistance so you ride easier—even on hilly terrain carrying a full load. You can carry up to max. 361 lbs/164 kg on the e-cargo bike and still have a smooth, nimble ride. It comes with a 500 Wh battery and offers an auxiliary battery option to increase your range if needed. With the range of accessories available you can build the PakYak E+ in different configurations to fit the different needs of your lifestyle.",
